Bloodfin: {
}

Brimlish.QuestDescription: Did you really defeat that big fire lady? Well, I heard that her children fled into the lava, and one of them mutated into a fish! I'm not burning my hands though, so you catch it and bring it to me for my lava-filled tank!

BrimstoneCrate: {
}

