CoastalDemonfish: {
}

CragBullhead: {
}

DragoonDrizzlefish: {
	TooltipNormal:
		'''
		Fires an assortment of hellfire and brimstone fireballs
		Sometimes fires a larger splitting fireball
		The brimstone sac appears to contain fuel
		'Revenge is a dish best served flaming hot'
		'''
	TooltipGFB:
		'''
		Fires an assortment of hellfire and brimstone fireballs
		Sometimes fires a larger splitting fireball
		<right> to feed the little boy some tasty gel
		'He is a hungry boy'
		'''
}

Havocfish.QuestDescription: When you killed that gross flesh wall, so much chaos and havoc was infused into those ruinous crags that even the lava sprouted fish made of the pure essence! Go fetch it for me, pure havoc sounds like exactly what my next scheme needs!

Shadowfish: {
}

SlagCrate: {
}

Slurpfish.QuestDescription: Hey {0}, wouldn't it be absolutely calamitous if I sent you to those ruins in the depths of hell? Well, I heard of a scary fish that can slurp the souls out of people! I want to keep my soul, so scram! The fish isn't going to catch itself!

