CoralskinFoolfish: {
}

EutrophicCrate: {
}

EutrophicSandfish.QuestDescription: You ever wondered what would happen if a lizard that lived in the desert wandered too deep into those old Ilmeran areas? Well I know, and it looks super cool! But it's way too slippery for me to get my hands on, so you go and get it so I can keep it as a pet!

