SurfClam.QuestDescription: Rumor has it that a massive swarm of clams has taken over that sea under the desert! Clams are a delicacy, so just hearing that makes me hungry! Will you help me curb my hunger? Of course you will! Just make sure my clam and you make it back in one piece!

// Other Catches
EnchantedStarfish: {
}

FishofEleum.QuestDescription: It's so unfair that all the cool fish only come out when you slay big demon guys! I mean that "cool" in two ways by the way. I've seen fish in the tundra materialized out of the essence of pure coldness! It's about time I get an ice pack for my fish, so fetch me that fish, or you're cold!

